      setup: ['Tee height: half the ball above the top of the clubhead.', 'Stance a little wider than the shoulders, ball off the inside of the left heel.', 'Right shoulder naturally lower than the left, upper body tilted slightly right.', 'Club behind the ball, about 55% of your weight on the right foot.'],
      steps: ['Wide takeaway: club low and slow to make a big arc.', 'Full shoulder turn to the top.', 'Start down with the lower body, keeping the upper body behind the ball.', 'The club reaches its low point before the ball, so it sweeps up through it.', 'High, full finish in balance.'],
