    "新手 {n} 到 {n} 顆就很夠了。比起打很多顆，每一顆都選一個目標、打完停下來想一想更重要。打太多只會累，動作也會越來越亂。": "{n} to {n} balls is plenty for a beginner. Picking a target for every ball and stopping to think after each one matters more than hitting lots. Hit too many and you just get tired and sloppy.",
    "新手一次 {n}–{n} 顆就夠了，每一顆都要有目標，不要連續猛打。": "{n}–{n} balls is enough for a beginner. Have a target for every ball; don’t just rake and hit.",
    "新手休閒打球時，打到「雙倍標準桿」還沒進洞，就把球撿起來，記下那個桿數。Par {n} 最多記 {n} 桿、Par {n} 最多記 {n} 桿。": "In casual golf, if you reach double par and still haven’t holed out, pick up and write down that number. On a par {n} the most you write is {n}; on a par {n}, {n}.",
