    "每 {n} 洞": "per {n} holes",
    "每一列以名稱開頭，接著 {n} 洞的數字。Putts、Penalty（罰桿）、Fairway（{n} = 上球道）、Drive（開球碼數）與 Bunker（{n} = 進了果嶺邊沙坑）都可以省略。": "Each row starts with a name followed by the numbers for {n} holes. Putts, Penalty, Fairway ({n} = hit), Drive (yards) and Bunker ({n} = in a greenside bunker) are optional.",
