    "沒上果嶺時只有 {n}% 保住 Par。用 Shot Selector 選對打法，再練 Up & Down 挑戰。": "You made par only {n}% of the time after missing the green. Use the Shot Selector to pick the right shot, then practise the Up & Down challenge.",
    "沒有標準答案。我的建議是：在練習場用 {n} 號鐵打 {n} 顆，大部分都能往前飛，就可以考慮了。第一次最好找有經驗的朋友一起去。": "There’s no set answer. My rule of thumb: when most of {n} balls with a {n} iron fly forward at the range, you’re ready to think about it. Go with an experienced friend the first time.",
