    "到櫃台買球，通常是按籃或按顆數計費，有些用球卡或代幣。": "Buy balls at the counter, usually by the basket or by count; some ranges use a ball card or tokens.",
    "剛開始看到球袋裡十幾支桿，很容易一頭霧水。其實新手只需要知道幾件事：每支桿大概打多遠、什麼時候用，還有第一套該買哪幾支。": "A bag with a dozen-plus clubs can be confusing at first. Beginners only need to know a few things: roughly how far each club goes, when to use it, and which ones to buy first.",
