    "可以。在每一頁最下面打開「左手球員模式」，所有圖都會左右對調。文字還是用右手寫的，讀的時候把左、右換過來就好。": "Yes. Turn on “Left-handed mode” at the bottom of any page and every diagram flips. The text is still written for right-handers, so just swap left and right as you read.",
