    "台灣多數球場會安排桿弟與球車，費用通常包含果嶺費、桿弟費、球車費；平日多半比假日便宜。": "Most courses in Taiwan assign a caddie and a cart; the fee usually covers green fees, caddie and cart, and weekdays are usually cheaper than weekends.",
