    "第一次下場的目標不是分數，而是「安全、跟上速度、享受」。打不好就撿起來放到果嶺邊，一起推桿就好，沒有人會介意。": "Your goal for your first round isn’t a score. It’s to stay safe, keep up and enjoy it. If a hole is going badly, pick up, drop by the green and putt out with everyone. Nobody minds.",
